  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supp phase5 of Mkapa Fellows Progr to strengthen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of Mkapa Fellows phase five programme is to improve Health and Community Systems and Services for addressing maternal, newborn, child and adolescent health challenges in Dodoma region in Tanzania. The programme works to strengthen human resources for health, including community health workers, through deployment and capacity development while collaborating with the Irish Health Service Executive to strengthen quality of primary healthcare services. It also works to strengthen the resilience of the health system to deal with climate shocks, including climate-sensitive diseases</narrative>
  </description>
